    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small rhythms don't really work when the thing that made you *you* is just gone. i look at my hands or my legs and they just feel like broken tools. it's not even just sadness anymore, it's like... there's nothing left to actually do. like the story reached the end and i'm just a character waiting for the credits to roll.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
