    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"just being\" feels so pointless. it's like being a ghost in my own life. if the peak was already over, and the person who actually mattered is gone, why am i just dragging this shell around? it feels less like \"being\" and more like just... lingering. like there's no point in staying for a sequel that isn't even good.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
